                            <h2>Information you send me</h2>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email address, subject and message. I use it only to read and reply to your message.</li>
                                <li><strong>Newsletter form:</strong> your email address. I use it to send you new articles from this site.</li>
                                <li><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> the buttons on the Services page open a chat with me on WhatsApp. Anything you send there is handled by WhatsApp under its own privacy policy.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>
                                The two forms on this site are collected and stored by Netlify, the company that hosts the website.
                                I keep messages and email addresses only as long as needed for the purpose above, and I delete them when you ask.
                            </p>

                            <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Google Analytics</strong> sets cookies to count visits and see which pages are read. It only runs if you press <em>Accept</em> in the cookie banner. If you decline, it does not load. You can change your choice at any time with <em>Cookie settings</em> in the footer.</li>
                                <li><strong>Cloudflare Web Analytics</strong> measures page views without cookies and without tracking you across other websites.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>
                                Your choice is remembered in your browser (local storage), not on my servers.
                            </p>

                            <h2>Other services this site uses</h2>
                            <p>To display pages, your browser connects to the companies below, which can see your IP address and browser details when it does:</p>
                            <ul>
                                <li><strong>Netlify</strong> hosts the website.</li>
                                <li><strong>Google Fonts</strong> supplies the text font.</li>
                                <li><strong>Cloudflare (cdnjs)</strong>, <strong>jsDelivr</strong> and <strong>jQuery CDN</strong> supply icons and page scripts.</li>
                                <li><strong>YouTube</strong> supplies video thumbnails on the Videos page. A video player is only loaded when you choose to play a video, or on an article that has a video embedded in it. Embedded videos use YouTube's privacy-enhanced mode.</li>
                            </ul>
                            <p>The share buttons under articles are plain links. They send nothing to social networks unless you click them.</p>
